COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.match_type IS 'BROAD | PHRASE | EXACT | TARGETING_EXPRESSION | TARGETING_EXPRESSION_PREDEFINED (auto and product targets).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.targeting IS 'The target expression: the keyword text, loose-match / close-match / substitutes / complements, asin="..." or category="...".';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.campaign_name IS 'Campaign name on the report row.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.ad_group_name IS 'Ad group name on the report row.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.keyword IS 'Target text as the report names it: the keyword, or loose-match / close-match / substitutes / complements for auto targets, or an asin or category expression.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.impressions IS 'Impressions.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.clicks IS 'Clicks.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.cost IS 'Ad spend, US dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.purchases_7d IS 'Purchases credited to the ad within Amazon''s 7-day attribution window (the only window these reports carry).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.sales_7d IS 'Sales dollars credited to the ad within the 7-day window.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.loaded_at IS 'When the row was last written by the loader.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.product_slug IS 'vita-bull | beef-liver | boneflex | vita-belle | vital-flow when the ad group advertises one product; NULL when it advertises several (product_resolution ''mixed'') or none is mapped (''unmapped'').';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.product_name IS 'Display name of product_slug; NULL when product_slug is NULL.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_targeting_daily.product_resolution IS 'single | mixed | unmapped: how the ad group''s product was found (product ads -> ASIN -> amazon_asin_products).';
COMMENT ON VIEW analytics.amazon_ads_keywords_snapshot IS 'Sponsored Products keywords with their current bid and state, one snapshot per load date: the bid history accumulates as snapshots are loaded on later days. Grain: one row per (snapshot_date, keyword_id). Source: public.amazon_ads_keywords_snapshot joined to the product of the ad group (analytics.amazon_ads_ad_group_products). Refresh: manual: python -m etl.amazon_dash_load --dir <folder of Data Dash pulls>; idempotent upsert on the natural key; not scheduled. Coverage: one snapshot (2026-11-12, 3,677 keywords: 3,227 enabled, 450 paused); archived keywords are not returned by Amazon; no bid history exists before the first snapshot. Caveats: snapshot_date is the date in the snapshot folder name; the latest snapshot is the current bid. Ad group level only (the ad group list was not pulled, so there is no ad group default bid). | product_slug is NULL for an ad group that advertises more than one product (product_resolution = ''mixed'') and for one with no product ad on file or no mapped ASIN (''unmapped''): count those rows as ''no single product'', never as a product.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_keywords_snapshot.snapshot_date IS 'Date of the snapshot (from the folder name).';
