COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_keywords_snapshot.product_slug IS 'vita-bull | beef-liver | boneflex | vita-belle | vital-flow when the ad group advertises one product; NULL when it advertises several (product_resolution ''mixed'') or none is mapped (''unmapped'').';
COMMENT ON COLUMN analytics.amazon_ads_keywords_snapshot.product_name IS 'Display name of product_slug; NULL when product_slug is NULL.';
