COMMENT ON VIEW analytics.amazon_ads_product_ads IS 'Sponsored Products product ads: which ASIN and SKU each campaign and ad group advertises. The map that gives every keyword row its product. Grain: one row per ad_id (the latest snapshot that holds it). Source: public.amazon_ads_product_ads joined to amazon_asin_products on the ASIN. Refresh: manual: python -m etl.amazon_dash_load --dir <folder of Data Dash pulls>; idempotent upsert on the natural key; not scheduled. Coverage: 1,063 product ads from the 2026-11-13 snapshot. Caveats: Latest map, not history: an ad that disappears from a later snapshot keeps its older snapshot_date. An ad group with ASINs of more than one product resolves to no single product (see analytics.amazon_ads_ad_group_products).';
